1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:02,160
The sea is perfect today.

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,960
Look at it, like oil.

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,259
And I'm not going in.

4
00:00:05,259 --> 00:00:06,019
Why?

5
00:00:06,019 --> 00:00:07,419
Giulia is late.

6
00:00:07,419 --> 00:00:08,339
Eighty-five years

7
00:00:08,339 --> 00:00:09,480
I swim here, and I

8
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,839
never go in alone.

9
00:00:10,839 --> 00:00:11,560
Never.

10
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,279
Not at nine,

11
00:00:12,279 --> 00:00:13,759
not at ninety-four.

12
00:00:13,759 --> 00:00:14,539
Twenty minutes I

13
00:00:14,539 --> 00:00:15,820
sit on this rock,

14
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,100
like a seagull,

15
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,219
waiting for a girl who

16
00:00:18,219 --> 00:00:19,940
can't find her shoes.

17
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:20,780
The sea will wait.

18
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,600
The sea always waits.

19
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,859
Ah, there she is! Giulietta!

20
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:26,780
Twenty minutes!

